          "kind": "informational",
          "level": "none",
          "guid": "mt3bviwp3gl9svgb",
          "message": {
            "text": "The resizer must not be searched as a UA-shadow node. Pinned PaintLayerScrollableArea source creates an anonymous LayoutCustomScrollbarPart from kPseudoIdResizer, and a live Chromium probe confirmed no pierced resizer node exists. The authoritative split is therefore CDP pseudo-match origins on the host plus the native resizer computed-style surface for final longhands; parsing matching declarations would recreate the broken cascade approximation.",
            "markdown": "The resizer must not be searched as a UA-shadow node. Pinned PaintLayerScrollableArea source creates an anonymous LayoutCustomScrollbarPart from kPseudoIdResizer, and a live Chromium probe confirmed no pierced resizer node exists. The authoritative split is therefore CDP pseudo-match origins on the host plus the native resizer computed-style surface for final longhands; parsing matching declarations would recreate the broken cascade approximation."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/capture/pseudo-style-cdp.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 377,
                  "endLine": 393,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "    // `::-webkit-resizer` has no UA-shadow DOM node: Blink resolves its style\n    // on demand and assigns it to an anonymous LayoutCustomScrollbarPart.\n    // Query only hosts whose computed `resize` is active, then combine the\n    // host's CDP pseudo-match metadata with the browser's native pseudo\n    // getComputedStyle surface.\n    const resizableObjectIds = await collectResizableRemoteObjects(session, objectGroup);\n    for (const objectId of resizableObjectIds) {\n      const requested = await session.send(\"DOM.requestNode\", { objectId });\n      if (requested.nodeId === 0) continue;\n      const matched = await session.send(\"CSS.getMatchedStylesForNode\", { nodeId: requested.nodeId });\n      if (!hasAuthorPseudoOrigin(resizerMatchedOrigins(matched))) continue;\n      await store(\n        requested.nodeId,\n        \"resizer\",\n        await computedResizerProperties(session, objectId),\n        objectId,\n      );"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
